  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterMetro2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - CYBER.
  - Can you not yell? What do you want from me now?
  - I came to annoy you. On purpose.
  - What? Are you out of your mind?
  - "No. You\u2019ve finally pissed me off for good. So I\u2019m going to act like
    you. "
  - "From now on, you fill out your reports yourself, I\u2019m not covering your
    tech expenses, and, as you love to say: \u201CIf you like it so much, deal with
    it yourself.\u201D "
  - "I\u2019m not giving you part of my budget anymore either. I\u2019ll spend it
    on food. The noodles are now mine. If you wanna eat \u2014 cook for yourself. "
  - Watched too many family dramas?
  - 'No. I just discovered that my noodles are gone again. '
  - "That\u2019s the reason for your tantrum? If you\u2019re done, leave me alone. "
  - "Oh I\u2019m done. And I\u2019m leaving you without budget too. "
  - "What\u2019s that supposed to mean?"
  - 'It means I filed a complaint on you. '
  - What?
  - Your budget got cut to minimum. The only two times I asked YOU to handle YOUR
    OWN activity reports, you missed both deadlines.
  - 'I got blamed for it. Then I found holes in the financial logs, searched your
    room, and found piles of useless junk. Four kinds of gamepads. '
  - "Because of your crap I had to redistribute money to buy food. I\u2019m done
    with it \u2014 now you deal with everything yourself. And guess what? I\u2019M
    NOT TALKING TO YOU ANYMORE EITHER. "
  - "Oh, really?! Fine. Then I\u2019ll just keep doing what I always do. They can
    kick me from the squad \u2014 and you\u2019ll forgive me as always, sentimental
    mess that you are. "
  - "You really should stop hanging out with Asahi and Beast so much. You\u2019re
    becoming even more of a pushover. Or is this Ferret rubbing off on you with her
    romantic worldview? "
  - "Blah-blah. Bye. By the way, I resold the gamepads \u2014 now I have money for
    NOODLES. "
  - YOU WHAT?!
